id: super-spirit-sword
name: Super Spirit Sword
advancement: true
prerequisite: Force or Magic Score of 12+
tpCost: 15
swordAgain: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Damage dealt by Spirit Sword on your turn: Spirit Sword once more this turn.
text: >
  Super Spirit Sword: Your energy weapon persists after your attack, allowing you to use it again.
  –Prerequisites: Force or Magic Score of 12+
  –TP Cost: 15
  –Effect: If you deal Damage to an Opponent with the Attacking Maneuver through the effects of Spirit Sword during
  your turn, you may use the Spirit Sword Unique Ability an additional time during this turn.
